        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "Prepared by: Colin Mackey, Staff Accountant\nEngagement: Riverbend Cleanup (FY 2025 tax compliance)\nDate: February 14, 2026"
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "1. PBC Request"
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "To: Riverbend Cleanup – Management\nFrom: Colin Mackey, Stonebridge Advisors\nRe: Information needed for the FY 2025 tax engagement"
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "Please provide the following items by March 6, 2026, so we can complete the Form 1065 and related schedules. Items marked with an asterisk (*) are critical for the initial draft."
      },
      {
        "kind": "list",
        "ordered": true,
        "items": [
          "Entity documents: current operating agreement, any amendments, and a copy of the EIN confirmation letter.",
          "* Trial balance as of December 31, 2025, in Excel format (preferably a GL export with account-level detail).",
          "General ledger detail for all cash accounts, including bank reconciliations for each month of 2025.",
          "* Fixed asset schedule: acquisitions, dispositions, depreciation method, and prior accumulated depreciation.",
          "All capital expenditure invoices/receipts for 2025 (if not already captured in the fixed asset schedule).",
          "Loan statements and payoff schedules for any debt outstanding as of December 31, 2025.",
          "Partner capital account rollforwards for 2025 (beginning balance, contributions, distributions, allocations).",
          "K-1s from any investments held by the partnership (e.g., other partnerships or funds).",
          "1099s issued to vendors/contractors for 2025, and any 1099-NEC or 1099-MISC received by Riverbend.",
          "* Schedule of all owner/partner draws or distributions made during 2025, with dates and amounts.",
          "Copies of any state or local tax notices received during 2025.",
          "A summary of any cleanup-related grants, subsidies, or reimbursements received in 2025."
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "Please upload the requested items to the secure client portal or email them directly to me (colin.mackey@stonebridgeadvisors.com). If you anticipate any delays, let me know as soon as possible."
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "2. Client Master List Entry"
      },
